button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li></ul><!--]--><!--]--></div></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="bg-white dark:bg-blue-950 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-500 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-9157-revised-iana-considerations-for-dnssec" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc9157/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">9157</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> Revised IANA Considerations for DNSSEC</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Proposed Standard<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">P. Hoffman<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->December 2021</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Operations and Management Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-9157" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 9157"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-9157" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This document changes the review requirements needed to get DNSSEC algorithms and resource records added to IANA registries.  It updates RFC 6014 to include hash algorithms for Delegation Signer (DS) records and NextSECure version 3 (NSEC3) parameters (for Hashed Authenticated Denial of Existence).  It also updates RFCs 5155 and 6014, which have requirements for DNSSEC algorithms, and updates RFC 8624 to clarify the implementation recommendation related to the algorithms described in RFCs that are not on the standards track.  The rationale for these changes is to bring the requirements for DS records and hash algorithms used in NSEC3 in line with the requirements for all other DNSSEC algorithms.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This document changes the review requirements needed to get DNSSEC algorithms and resource records added to IANA registries.  It updates RFC 6014 to include hash algorithms for Delegation Signer (DS) records and NextSECure version 3 (NSEC3) parameters (for Hashed Authenticated Denial of Existence).  It also updates RFCs 5155 and 6014, which have requirements for DNSSEC algorithms, and updates RFC 8624 to clarify the implementation recommendation related to the algorithms described in RFCs that are not on the standards track.  The rationale for these changes is to bring the requirements for DS records and hash algorithms used in NSEC3 in line with the requirements for all other DNSSEC algorithms.</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 1.996a7.49 7.49 0 0 1 7.496 7.25l.004.25v4.097l1.38 3.156a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.145 1.75L15 18.502a3 3 0 0 1-5.995.177L9 18.499H4.275a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.147-1.747L4.5 13.594V9.496c0-4.155 3.352-7.5 7.5-7.5M13.5 18.5l-3 .002a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.993.145zM12 3.496c-3.32 0-6 2.674-6 6v4.41L4.656 17h14.697L18 13.907V9.509l-.003-.225A5.99 5.99 0 0 0 12 3.496"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Subscribe</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li><li><div class="relative flex flex-row md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12S6.477 2 12 2m0 1.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 0 17a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-17M12 7a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h3.5v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 7"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Add to Set</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li></ul><!--]--><!--]--></div></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="bg-white dark:bg-blue-950 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-500 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-9102-tls-dnssec-chain-extension" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc9102/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">9102</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> TLS DNSSEC Chain Extension</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Experimental<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">V. Dukhovni<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">S. Huque<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">W. Toorop<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">P. Wouters<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">M. Shore<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->August 2021</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Independent Stream publication</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-9102" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 9102"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-9102" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This document describes an experimental TLS extension for the in-band transport of the complete set of records that can be validated by DNSSEC and that are needed to perform DNS-Based Authentication of Named Entities (DANE) of a TLS server. This extension obviates the need to perform separate, out-of-band DNS lookups. When the requisite DNS records do not exist, the extension conveys a denial-of-existence proof that can be validated.</p><p></p><p> This experimental extension is developed outside the IETF and is published here to guide implementation of the extension and to ensure interoperability among implementations.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This document describes an experimental TLS extension for the in-band transport of the complete set of records that can be validated by DNSSEC and that are needed to perform DNS-Based Authentication of Named Entities (DANE) of a TLS server. This extension obviates the need to perform separate, out-of-band DNS lookups. When the requisite DNS records do not exist, the extension conveys a denial-of-existence proof that can be validated.</p><p></p><p> This experimental extension is developed outside the IETF and is published here to guide implementation of the extension and to ensure interoperability among implementations.</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 1.996a7.49 7.49 0 0 1 7.496 7.25l.004.25v4.097l1.38 3.156a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.145 1.75L15 18.502a3 3 0 0 1-5.995.177L9 18.499H4.275a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.147-1.747L4.5 13.594V9.496c0-4.155 3.352-7.5 7.5-7.5M13.5 18.5l-3 .002a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.993.145zM12 3.496c-3.32 0-6 2.674-6 6v4.41L4.656 17h14.697L18 13.907V9.509l-.003-.225A5.99 5.99 0 0 0 12 3.496"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Subscribe</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li><li><div class="relative flex flex-row md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12S6.477 2 12 2m0 1.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 0 17a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-17M12 7a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h3.5v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 7"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Add to Set</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li></ul><!--]--><!--]--></div></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="bg-white dark:bg-blue-950 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-500 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-9077-nsec-and-nsec-3-ttls-and-aggressive-use" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc9077/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">9077</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> NSEC and NSEC3: TTLs and Aggressive Use</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Proposed Standard<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">P. van Dijk<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->July 2021</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Operations and Management Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-9077" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 9077"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-9077" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>Due to a combination of unfortunate wording in earlier documents, aggressive use of NSEC and NSEC3 records may deny the existence of names far beyond the intended lifetime of a denial.  This document changes the definition of the NSEC and NSEC3 TTL to correct that situation.  This document updates RFCs 4034, 4035, 5155, and 8198.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>Due to a combination of unfortunate wording in earlier documents, aggressive use of NSEC and NSEC3 records may deny the existence of names far beyond the intended lifetime of a denial.  This document changes the definition of the NSEC and NSEC3 TTL to correct that situation.  This document updates RFCs 4034, 4035, 5155, and 8198.</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 1.996a7.49 7.49 0 0 1 7.496 7.25l.004.25v4.097l1.38 3.156a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.145 1.75L15 18.502a3 3 0 0 1-5.995.177L9 18.499H4.275a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.147-1.747L4.5 13.594V9.496c0-4.155 3.352-7.5 7.5-7.5M13.5 18.5l-3 .002a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.993.145zM12 3.496c-3.32 0-6 2.674-6 6v4.41L4.656 17h14.697L18 13.907V9.509l-.003-.225A5.99 5.99 0 0 0 12 3.496"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Subscribe</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li><li><div class="relative flex flex-row md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12S6.477 2 12 2m0 1.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 0 17a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-17M12 7a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h3.5v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 7"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Add to Set</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li></ul><!--]--><!--]--></div></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="bg-white dark:bg-blue-950 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-500 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-8976-message-digest-for-dns-zones" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc8976/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">8976</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> Message Digest for DNS Zones</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Proposed Standard<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">D. Wessels<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">P. Barber<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">M. Weinberg<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">W. Kumari<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">W. Hardaker<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->February 2021</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Operations and Management Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-8976" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 8976"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-8976" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This document describes a protocol and new DNS Resource Record that provides a cryptographic message digest over DNS zone data at rest. The ZONEMD Resource Record conveys the digest data in the zone itself. When used in combination with DNSSEC, ZONEMD allows recipients to verify the zone contents for data integrity and origin authenticity. This provides assurance that received zone data matches published data, regardless of how the zone data has been transmitted and received. When used without DNSSEC, ZONEMD functions as a checksum, guarding only against unintentional changes.</p><p></p><p> ZONEMD does not replace DNSSEC: DNSSEC protects individual RRsets (DNS data with fine granularity), whereas ZONEMD protects a zone&#39;s data as a whole, whether consumed by authoritative name servers, recursive name servers, or any other applications.</p><p></p><p> As specified herein, ZONEMD is impractical for large, dynamic zones due to the time and resources required for digest calculation. However, the ZONEMD record is extensible so that new digest schemes may be added in the future to support large, dynamic zones.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This document describes a protocol and new DNS Resource Record that provides a cryptographic message digest over DNS zone data at rest. The ZONEMD Resource Record conveys the digest data in the zone itself. When used in combination with DNSSEC, ZONEMD allows recipients to verify the zone contents for data integrity and origin authenticity. This provides assurance that received zone data matches published data, regardless of how the zone data has been transmitted and received. When used without DNSSEC, ZONEMD functions as a checksum, guarding only against unintentional changes.</p><p></p><p> ZONEMD does not replace DNSSEC: DNSSEC protects individual RRsets (DNS data with fine granularity), whereas ZONEMD protects a zone&#39;s data as a whole, whether consumed by authoritative name servers, recursive name servers, or any other applications.</p><p></p><p> As specified herein, ZONEMD is impractical for large, dynamic zones due to the time and resources required for digest calculation. However, the ZONEMD record is extensible so that new digest schemes may be added in the future to support large, dynamic zones.</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 1.996a7.49 7.49 0 0 1 7.496 7.25l.004.25v4.097l1.38 3.156a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.145 1.75L15 18.502a3 3 0 0 1-5.995.177L9 18.499H4.275a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.147-1.747L4.5 13.594V9.496c0-4.155 3.352-7.5 7.5-7.5M13.5 18.5l-3 .002a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.993.145zM12 3.496c-3.32 0-6 2.674-6 6v4.41L4.656 17h14.697L18 13.907V9.509l-.003-.225A5.99 5.99 0 0 0 12 3.496"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Subscribe</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li><li><div class="relative flex flex-row md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12S6.477 2 12 2m0 1.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 0 17a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-17M12 7a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h3.5v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 7"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Add to Set</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li></ul><!--]--><!--]--></div></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="bg-white dark:bg-blue-950 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-500 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-8901-multi-signer-dnssec-models" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc8901/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">8901</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> Multi-Signer DNSSEC Models</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Informational<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">S. Huque<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">P. Aras<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">J. Dickinson<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">J. Vcelak<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">D. Blacka<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->September 2020</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Operations and Management Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-8901" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 8901"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-8901" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>Many enterprises today employ the service of multiple DNS providers to distribute their authoritative DNS service.  Deploying DNSSEC in such an environment may present some challenges, depending on the configuration and feature set in use.  In particular, when each DNS provider independently signs zone data with their own keys, additional key-management mechanisms are necessary.  This document presents deployment models that accommodate this scenario and describes these key-management requirements.  These models do not require any changes to the behavior of validating resolvers, nor do they impose the new key-management requirements on authoritative servers not involved in multi-signer configurations.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>Many enterprises today employ the service of multiple DNS providers to distribute their authoritative DNS service.  Deploying DNSSEC in such an environment may present some challenges, depending on the configuration and feature set in use.  In particular, when each DNS provider independently signs zone data with their own keys, additional key-management mechanisms are necessary.  This document presents deployment models that accommodate this scenario and describes these key-management requirements.  These models do not require any changes to the behavior of validating resolvers, nor do they impose the new key-management requirements on authoritative servers not involved in multi-signer configurations.</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 1.996a7.49 7.49 0 0 1 7.496 7.25l.004.25v4.097l1.38 3.156a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.145 1.75L15 18.502a3 3 0 0 1-5.995.177L9 18.499H4.275a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.147-1.747L4.5 13.594V9.496c0-4.155 3.352-7.5 7.5-7.5M13.5 18.5l-3 .002a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.993.145zM12 3.496c-3.32 0-6 2.674-6 6v4.41L4.656 17h14.697L18 13.907V9.509l-.003-.225A5.99 5.99 0 0 0 12 3.496"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Subscribe</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li><li><div class="relative flex flex-row md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12S6.477 2 12 2m0 1.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 0 17a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-17M12 7a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h3.5v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 7"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Add to Set</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li></ul><!--]--><!--]--></div></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="bg-white dark:bg-blue-950 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-500 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-8749-moving-dnssec-lookaside-validation-dlv-to-historic-status" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc8749/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">8749</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> Moving DNSSEC Lookaside Validation (DLV) to Historic Status</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Proposed Standard<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">W. Mekking<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">D. Mahoney<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->March 2020</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Operations and Management Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-8749" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 8749"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-8749" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This document retires DNSSEC Lookaside Validation (DLV) and reclassifies RFCs 4431 and 5074 as Historic.  Furthermore, this document updates RFC 6698 by excluding the DLV resource record from certificates and updates RFC 6840 by excluding the DLV registries from the trust anchor selection.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This document retires DNSSEC Lookaside Validation (DLV) and reclassifies RFCs 4431 and 5074 as Historic.  Furthermore, this document updates RFC 6698 by excluding the DLV resource record from certificates and updates RFC 6840 by excluding the DLV registries from the trust anchor selection.</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 1.996a7.49 7.49 0 0 1 7.496 7.25l.004.25v4.097l1.38 3.156a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.145 1.75L15 18.502a3 3 0 0 1-5.995.177L9 18.499H4.275a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.147-1.747L4.5 13.594V9.496c0-4.155 3.352-7.5 7.5-7.5M13.5 18.5l-3 .002a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.993.145zM12 3.496c-3.32 0-6 2.674-6 6v4.41L4.656 17h14.697L18 13.907V9.509l-.003-.225A5.99 5.99 0 0 0 12 3.496"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Subscribe</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li><li><div class="relative flex flex-row md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12S6.477 2 12 2m0 1.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 0 17a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-17M12 7a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h3.5v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 7"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Add to Set</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li></ul><!--]--><!--]--></div></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="bg-white dark:bg-blue-950 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-500 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-8683-additional-deployment-guidelines-for-nat-64464-xlat-in-operator-and-enterprise-networks" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc8683/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">8683</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> Additional Deployment Guidelines for NAT64/464XLAT in Operator and Enterprise Networks</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Informational<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">J. Palet Martinez<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->November 2019</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Operations and Management Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-8683" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 8683"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-8683" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This document describes how Network Address and Protocol Translation from IPv6 Clients to IPv4 Servers (NAT64) (including 464XLAT) can be deployed in an IPv6 network -- whether it&#39;s cellular ISP, broadband ISP, or enterprise -- and the possible optimizations.  This document also discusses issues to be considered when having IPv6-only connectivity, such as: a) DNS64, b) applications or devices that use literal IPv4 addresses or non-IPv6-compliant APIs, and c) IPv4-only hosts or applications.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This document describes how Network Address and Protocol Translation from IPv6 Clients to IPv4 Servers (NAT64) (including 464XLAT) can be deployed in an IPv6 network -- whether it&#39;s cellular ISP, broadband ISP, or enterprise -- and the possible optimizations.  This document also discusses issues to be considered when having IPv6-only connectivity, such as: a) DNS64, b) applications or devices that use literal IPv4 addresses or non-IPv6-compliant APIs, and c) IPv4-only hosts or applications.</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 1.996a7.49 7.49 0 0 1 7.496 7.25l.004.25v4.097l1.38 3.156a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.145 1.75L15 18.502a3 3 0 0 1-5.995.177L9 18.499H4.275a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.147-1.747L4.5 13.594V9.496c0-4.155 3.352-7.5 7.5-7.5M13.5 18.5l-3 .002a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.993.145zM12 3.496c-3.32 0-6 2.674-6 6v4.41L4.656 17h14.697L18 13.907V9.509l-.003-.225A5.99 5.99 0 0 0 12 3.496"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Subscribe</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li><li><div class="relative flex flex-row md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12S6.477 2 12 2m0 1.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 0 17a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-17M12 7a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h3.5v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 7"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Add to Set</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li></ul><!--]--><!--]--></div></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="bg-pink-50 dark:bg-pink-950 border-pink-400 dark:border-pink-700 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-8624-algorithm-implementation-requirements-and-usage-guidance-for-dnssec" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc8624/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">8624</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> Algorithm Implementation Requirements and Usage Guidance for DNSSEC</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Proposed Standard<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">P. Wouters<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">O. Sury<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->June 2019</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Operations and Management Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-8624" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 8624"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-8624" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>The DNSSEC protocol makes use of various cryptographic algorithms in order to provide authentication of DNS data and proof of nonexistence.  To ensure interoperability between DNS resolvers and DNS authoritative servers, it is necessary to specify a set of algorithm implementation requirements and usage guidelines to ensure that there is at least one algorithm that all implementations support.  This document defines the current algorithm implementation requirements and usage guidance for DNSSEC.  This document obsoletes RFC 6944.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><p class="relative z-1 text-red-800 dark:text-red-300 text-base print:text-black"><ul class="inline-block">Obsoleted by <span class="inline-block p-1 -m-1">RFC <b>9904</b></span></ul></p></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>The DNSSEC protocol makes use of various cryptographic algorithms in order to provide authentication of DNS data and proof of nonexistence.  To ensure interoperability between DNS resolvers and DNS authoritative servers, it is necessary to specify a set of algorithm implementation requirements and usage guidelines to ensure that there is at least one algorithm that all implementations support.  This document defines the current algorithm implementation requirements and usage guidance for DNSSEC.  This document obsoletes RFC 6944.</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 1.996a7.49 7.49 0 0 1 7.496 7.25l.004.25v4.097l1.38 3.156a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.145 1.75L15 18.502a3 3 0 0 1-5.995.177L9 18.499H4.275a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.147-1.747L4.5 13.594V9.496c0-4.155 3.352-7.5 7.5-7.5M13.5 18.5l-3 .002a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.993.145zM12 3.496c-3.32 0-6 2.674-6 6v4.41L4.656 17h14.697L18 13.907V9.509l-.003-.225A5.99 5.99 0 0 0 12 3.496"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Subscribe</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li><li><div class="relative flex flex-row md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12S6.477 2 12 2m0 1.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 0 17a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-17M12 7a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h3.5v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 7"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Add to Set</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li></ul><!--]--><!--]--></div></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="bg-white dark:bg-blue-950 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-500 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-8509-a-root-key-trust-anchor-sentinel-for-dnssec" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc8509/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">8509</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> A Root Key Trust Anchor Sentinel for DNSSEC</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Proposed Standard<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">G. Huston<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">J. Damas<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">W. Kumari<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->December 2018</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Operations and Management Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-8509" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 8509"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-8509" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>The DNS Security Extensions (DNSSEC) were developed to provide origin authentication and integrity protection for DNS data by using digital signatures.  These digital signatures can be verified by building a chain of trust starting from a trust anchor and proceeding down to a particular node in the DNS.  This document specifies a mechanism that will allow an end user and third parties to determine the trusted key state for the root key of the resolvers that handle that user&#39;s DNS queries.  Note that this method is only applicable for determining which keys are in the trust store for the root key.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>The DNS Security Extensions (DNSSEC) were developed to provide origin authentication and integrity protection for DNS data by using digital signatures.  These digital signatures can be verified by building a chain of trust starting from a trust anchor and proceeding down to a particular node in the DNS.  This document specifies a mechanism that will allow an end user and third parties to determine the trusted key state for the root key of the resolvers that handle that user&#39;s DNS queries.  Note that this method is only applicable for determining which keys are in the trust store for the root key.</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 1.996a7.49 7.49 0 0 1 7.496 7.25l.004.25v4.097l1.38 3.156a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.145 1.75L15 18.502a3 3 0 0 1-5.995.177L9 18.499H4.275a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.147-1.747L4.5 13.594V9.496c0-4.155 3.352-7.5 7.5-7.5M13.5 18.5l-3 .002a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.993.145zM12 3.496c-3.32 0-6 2.674-6 6v4.41L4.656 17h14.697L18 13.907V9.509l-.003-.225A5.99 5.99 0 0 0 12 3.496"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Subscribe</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li><li><div class="relative flex flex-row md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12S6.477 2 12 2m0 1.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 0 17a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-17M12 7a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h3.5v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 7"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Add to Set</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li></ul><!--]--><!--]--></div></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="bg-white dark:bg-blue-950 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-500 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-8483-yeti-dns-testbed" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc8483/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">8483</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> Yeti DNS Testbed</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Informational<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">L. Song<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">D. Liu<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">P. Vixie<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">A. Kato<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">S. Kerr<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->October 2018</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Independent Stream publication</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-8483" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 8483"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-8483" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>Yeti DNS is an experimental, non-production root server testbed that provides an environment where technical and operational experiments can safely be performed without risk to production root server infrastructure.  This document aims solely to document the technical and operational experience of deploying a system that is similar to but different from the Root Server system (on which the Internet&#39;s Domain Name System is designed and built).</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>Yeti DNS is an experimental, non-production root server testbed that provides an environment where technical and operational experiments can safely be performed without risk to production root server infrastructure.  This document aims solely to document the technical and operational experience of deploying a system that is similar to but different from the Root Server system (on which the Internet&#39;s Domain Name System is designed and built).</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 1.996a7.49 7.49 0 0 1 7.496 7.25l.004.25v4.097l1.38 3.156a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.145 1.75L15 18.502a3 3 0 0 1-5.995.177L9 18.499H4.275a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.147-1.747L4.5 13.594V9.496c0-4.155 3.352-7.5 7.5-7.5M13.5 18.5l-3 .002a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.993.145zM12 3.496c-3.32 0-6 2.674-6 6v4.41L4.656 17h14.697L18 13.907V9.509l-.003-.225A5.99 5.99 0 0 0 12 3.496"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Subscribe</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li><li><div class="relative flex flex-row md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12S6.477 2 12 2m0 1.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 0 17a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-17M12 7a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h3.5v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 7"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Add to Set</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li></ul><!--]--><!--]--></div></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="bg-white dark:bg-blue-950 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-500 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-8198-aggressive-use-of-dnssec-validated-cache" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc8198/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">8198</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> Aggressive Use of DNSSEC-Validated Cache</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Proposed Standard<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">K. Fujiwara<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">A. Kato<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">W. Kumari<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->July 2017</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Operations and Management Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-8198" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 8198"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-8198" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>The DNS relies upon caching to scale; however, the cache lookup generally requires an exact match. This document specifies the use of NSEC/NSEC3 resource records to allow DNSSEC-validating resolvers to generate negative answers within a range and positive answers from wildcards. This increases performance, decreases latency, decreases resource utilization on both authoritative and recursive servers, and increases privacy. Also, it may help increase resilience to certain DoS attacks in some circumstances.</p><p></p><p> This document updates RFC 4035 by allowing validating resolvers to generate negative answers based upon NSEC/NSEC3 records and positive answers in the presence of wildcards.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>The DNS relies upon caching to scale; however, the cache lookup generally requires an exact match. This document specifies the use of NSEC/NSEC3 resource records to allow DNSSEC-validating resolvers to generate negative answers within a range and positive answers from wildcards. This increases performance, decreases latency, decreases resource utilization on both authoritative and recursive servers, and increases privacy. Also, it may help increase resilience to certain DoS attacks in some circumstances.</p><p></p><p> This document updates RFC 4035 by allowing validating resolvers to generate negative answers based upon NSEC/NSEC3 records and positive answers in the presence of wildcards.</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 1.996a7.49 7.49 0 0 1 7.496 7.25l.004.25v4.097l1.38 3.156a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.145 1.75L15 18.502a3 3 0 0 1-5.995.177L9 18.499H4.275a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.147-1.747L4.5 13.594V9.496c0-4.155 3.352-7.5 7.5-7.5M13.5 18.5l-3 .002a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.993.145zM12 3.496c-3.32 0-6 2.674-6 6v4.41L4.656 17h14.697L18 13.907V9.509l-.003-.225A5.99 5.99 0 0 0 12 3.496"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Subscribe</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li><li><div class="relative flex flex-row md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12S6.477 2 12 2m0 1.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 0 17a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-17M12 7a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h3.5v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 7"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Add to Set</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li></ul><!--]--><!--]--></div></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="bg-white dark:bg-blue-950 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-500 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-8145-signaling-trust-anchor-knowledge-in-dns-security-extensions-dnssec" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc8145/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">8145</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> Signaling Trust Anchor Knowledge in DNS Security Extensions (DNSSEC)</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Proposed Standard<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">D. Wessels<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">W. Kumari<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">P. Hoffman<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->April 2017</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Operations and Management Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-8145" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 8145"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-8145" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>The DNS Security Extensions (DNSSEC) were developed to provide origin authentication and integrity protection for DNS data by using digital signatures.  These digital signatures can be verified by building a chain of trust starting from a trust anchor and proceeding down to a particular node in the DNS.  This document specifies two different ways for validating resolvers to signal to a server which keys are referenced in their chain of trust.  The data from such signaling allow zone administrators to monitor the progress of rollovers in a DNSSEC-signed zone.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>The DNS Security Extensions (DNSSEC) were developed to provide origin authentication and integrity protection for DNS data by using digital signatures.  These digital signatures can be verified by building a chain of trust starting from a trust anchor and proceeding down to a particular node in the DNS.  This document specifies two different ways for validating resolvers to signal to a server which keys are referenced in their chain of trust.  The data from such signaling allow zone administrators to monitor the progress of rollovers in a DNSSEC-signed zone.</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 fo