 before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">7218</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> Adding Acronyms to Simplify Conversations about DNS-Based Authentication of Named Entities (DANE)</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Proposed Standard<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">O. Gudmundsson<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->April 2014</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Security Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-7218" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 7218"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-7218" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>Experience has shown that people get confused when discussing the three numeric fields of the TLSA record.  This document specifies descriptive acronyms for the three numeric fields in TLSA records.  This document updates the format of the IANA registry created by RFC 6698.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>Experience has shown that people get confused when discussing the three numeric fields of the TLSA record.  This document specifies descriptive acronyms for the three numeric fields in TLSA records.  This document updates the format of the IANA registry created by RFC 6698.</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 1.996a7.49 7.49 0 0 1 7.496 7.25l.004.25v4.097l1.38 3.156a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.145 1.75L15 18.502a3 3 0 0 1-5.995.177L9 18.499H