-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">6725</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> DNS Security (DNSSEC) DNSKEY Algorithm IANA Registry Updates</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Proposed Standard<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">S. Rose<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->August 2012</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Internet Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-6725" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 6725"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-6725" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>The DNS Security Extensions (DNSSEC) require the use of cryptographic algorithm suites for generating digital signatures over DNS data.  The algorithms specified for use with DNSSEC are reflected in an IANA-maintained registry.  This document presents a set of changes for some entries of the registry. [STANDARDS-TRACK]</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>The DNS Security Extensions (DNSSEC) require the use of cryptographic algorithm suites for generating digital signatures over DNS data.  The algorithms specified for use with DNSSEC are reflected in an IANA-maintained registry.  This document presents a set of changes for some entries of the registry. [STANDARDS-TRACK]</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 1.996a7.49 7.49 0 0 1 7.496 7.25l.004.25v4.097l1.38 3.156a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.145 1.75L15 18.502a3 3 0 0 1-5.995.177L9 18.499H4.275a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.147-1.747L4.5 13.594V9.496c0-4.155 3.352-7.5 7.5-7.5M13.5 18.5l-3 .002a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.993.145zM12 3.496c-3.32 0-6 2.674-6 6v4.41L4.656 17h14.697L18 13.907V9.509l-.003-.225A5.99 5.99 0 0 0 12 3.496"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Subscribe</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li><li><div class="relative flex flex-row md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12S6.477 2 12 2m0 1.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 0 17a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-17M12 7a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h3.5v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 7"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Add to Set</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li></ul><!--]--><!--]--></div></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="bg-white dark:bg-blue-950 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-500 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-6698-the-dns-based-authentication-of-named-entities-dane-transport-layer-security-tls-protocol-tlsa" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc6698/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">6698</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> The DNS-Based Authentication of Named Entities (DANE) Transport Layer Security (TLS) Protocol: TLSA</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Proposed Standard<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">P. Hoffman<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">J. Schlyter<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->August 2012</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Security Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-6698" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 6698"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-6698" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>Encrypted communication on the Internet often uses Transport Layer Security (TLS), which depends on third parties to certify the keys used.  This document improves on that situation by enabling the administrators of domain names to specify the keys used in that domain&#39;s TLS servers.  This requires matching improvements in TLS client software, but no change in TLS server software. [STANDARDS-TRACK]</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>Encrypted communication on the Internet often uses Transport Layer Security (TLS), which depends on third parties to certify the keys used.  This document improves on that situation by enabling the administrators of domain names to specify the keys used in that domain&#39;s TLS servers.  This requires matching improvements in TLS client software, but no change in TLS server software. [STANDARDS-TRACK]</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:abs