fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> DNSSEC Lookaside Validation (DLV)</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Historic<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">S. Weiler<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->November 2007</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-5074" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 5074"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-5074" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>DNSSEC Lookaside Validation (DLV) is a mechanism for publishing DNS Security (DNSSEC) trust anchors outside of the DNS delegation chain.  It allows validating resolvers to validate DNSSEC-signed data from zones whose ancestors either aren&#39;t signed or don&#39;t publish Delegation Signer (DS) records for their children.  This memo provides information for the Internet community.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>DNSSEC Lookaside Validation (DLV) is a mechanism for publishing DNS Security (DNSSEC) trust anchors outside of the DNS delegation chain.  It allows validating resolvers to validate DNSSEC-signed data from zones whose ancestors either aren&#39;t signed or don&#39;t publish Delegation Signer (DS) records for their children.  This memo provides information for the Internet community.</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 1.996a7.49 7.49 0 0 1 7.496 7.25l.004.25v4.097l1.38 3.156a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.145 1.75L15 18.502a3 3 0 0 1-5.995.177L9 18.499H4.275a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.147-1.747L4.5 13.594V9.496c0-4.155 3.352-7.5 7.5-7.5M13.5 18.5l-3 .002a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.993.145zM12 3.496c-3.32 0-6 2.674-6 6v4.41L4.656 17h14.697L18 13.907V9.509l-.003-.225A5.99 5.99 0 0 0 12 3.496"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Subscribe</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li><li><div class="relative flex flex-row md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12S6.477 2 12 2m0 1.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 0 17a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-17M12 7a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h3.5v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 7"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Add to Set</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li></ul><!--]--><!--]--></div></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="bg-white dark:bg-blue-950 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-500 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-5011-automated-updates-of-dns-security-dnssec-trust-anchors" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc5011/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">5011</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span><a href="/info/std74/" class="no-underline relative z-100 hover:underline focus:underline py-3 rounded text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300" title="STD 74 contains RFC 5011"><span><span class="font-medium">STD</span> <span class="font-bold">74</span>:</span></a></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> Automated Updates of DNS Security (DNSSEC) Trust Anchors</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Internet Standard<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">M. StJohns<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->September 2007</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Internet Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-5011" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 5011"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-5011" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This document describes a means for automated, authenticated, and authorized updating of DNSSEC &quot;trust anchors&quot;. The method provides protection against N-1 key compromises of N keys in the trust point key set. Based on the trust established by the presence of a current anchor, other anchors may be added at the same place in the hierarchy, and, ultimately, supplant the existing anchor(s).</p><p></p><p> This mechanism will require changes to resolver management behavior (but not resolver resolution behavior), and the addition of a single flag bit to the DNSKEY record. [STANDARDS-TRACK]</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This document describes a means for automated, authenticated, and authorized updating of DNSSEC &quot;trust anchors&quot;. The method provides protection against N-1 key compromises of N keys in the trust point key set. Based on the trust established by the presence of a current anchor, other anchors may be added at the same place in the hierarchy, and, ultimately, supplant the existing anchor(s).</p><p></p><p> This mechanism will require changes to resolver management behavior (but not resolver resolution behavior), and the addition of a single flag bit to the DNSKEY record. [STANDARDS-TRACK]</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 1.996a7.49 7.49 0 0 1 7.496 7.25l.004.25v4.097l1.38 3.156a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.145 1.75L15 18.502a3 3 0 0 1-5.995.177L9 18.499H4.275a1.25 1.25 0 0 1-1.147-1.747L4.5 13.594V9.496c0-4.155 3.352-7.5 7.5-7.5M13.5 18.5l-3 .002a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.993.145zM12 3.496c-3.32 0-6 2.674-6 6v4.41L4.656 17h14.697L18 13.907V9.509l-.003-.225A5.99 5.99 0 0 0 12 3.496"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Subscribe</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li><li><div class="relative flex flex-row md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12S6.477 2 12 2m0 1.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 0 17a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-17M12 7a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h3.5v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 7"></path></svg><span class="relative z-1">Add to Set</span><!--]--></button><!--v-if--><!--]--><!----></div></div></li></ul><!--]--><!--]--></div></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="bg-white dark:bg-blue-950 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-500 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-4986-requirements-related-to-dns-security-dnssec-trust-anchor-rollover" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc4986/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">4986</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> Requirements Related to DNS Security (DNSSEC) Trust Anchor Rollover</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Informational<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">H. Eland<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">R. Mundy<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">S. Crocker<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><li class="inline"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px]"></span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">S. Krishnaswamy<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->August 2007</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Internet Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-4986" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 4986"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-4986" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>Every DNS security-aware resolver must have at least one Trust Anchor to use as the basis for validating responses from DNS signed zones.  For various reasons, most DNS security-aware resolvers are expected to have several Trust Anchors.  For some operations, manual monitoring and updating of Trust Anchors may be feasible, but many operations will require automated methods for updating Trust Anchors in their security-aware resolvers.  This document identifies the requirements that must be met by an automated DNS Trust Anchor rollover solution for security-aware DNS resolvers.  This memo provides information for the Internet community.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>Every DNS security-aware resolver must have at least one Trust Anchor to use as the basis for validating responses from DNS signed zones.  For various reasons, most DNS security-aware resolvers are expected to have several Trust Anchors.  For some operations, manual monitoring and updating of Trust Anchors may be feasible, but many operations will require automated methods for updating Trust Anchors in their security-aware resolvers.  This document identifies the requirements that must be met by an automated DNS Trust Anchor rollover solution for security-aware DNS resolvers.  This memo provides information for the Internet community.</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24p