85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> Domain Name System Security (DNSSEC) Signing Authority</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Proposed Standard<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">B. Wellington<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->November 2000</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Internet Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-3008" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 3008"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-3008" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This document proposes a revised model of Domain Name System Security (DNSSEC) Signing Authority.  The revised model is designed to clarify earlier documents and add additional restrictions to simplify the secure resolution process.  Specifically, this affects the authorization of keys to sign sets of records. [STANDARDS-TRACK]</p><!--]--></div></div></div><p class="relative z-1 text-red-800 dark:text-red-300 text-base print:text-black"><ul class="inline-block">Obsoleted by <span class="inline-block p-1 -m-1">RFC <b>4033</b></span>, <span class="inline-block p-1 -m-1">RFC <b>4034</b></span>, <span class="inline-block p-1 -m-1">RFC <b>4035</b></span></ul></p></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This document proposes a revised model of Domain Name System Security (DNSSEC) Signing Authority.  The revised model is designed to clarify earlier documents and add additional restrictions to simplify the secure resolution process.  Specifically, this affects the authorization of keys to sign sets of records. [STANDARDS-TRACK]</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded 