.</p><!--]--></div></div></div><p class="relative z-1 text-red-800 dark:text-red-300 text-base print:text-black"><ul class="inline-block">Obsoleted by <span class="inline-block p-1 -m-1">RFC <b>4641</b></span></ul></p></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This document discusses these operational aspects for keys and signatures used in connection with the KEY and SIG DNS resource records.  This memo provides information for the Internet community.</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-25 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-sky-100 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:border-1 after:border-white dark:after:border-black after:rounded hover:after:border-blue-800 dark:hover:after:border-blue-25 focus:after:outline-2 focus:after:outline-black gap-1"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 w-[24px] h-[24px] sm:mr-1 relative z-1"><path fi