flex-col"><div class="bg-pink-50 dark:bg-pink-950 border-pink-400 dark:border-pink-700 relative border pl-5 pr-7 py-4 rounded shadow-xs print:border-2 print:border-black flex flex-col justify-between h-full"><!--[--><div class=""><h3 id="rfc-2137-secure-domain-name-system-dynamic-update" class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[22px] text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-feature-settings-calt-off group"><!----><!--[--><a href="/info/rfc2137/" class="font-semibold text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 print:text-black no-underline group before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-100 dark:focus:text-blue-100 hover:before:bg-blue-25 focus:before:bg-blue-25 dark:hover:before:bg-blue-900 dark:focus:before:bg-blue-900 after:shadow-blue-950/10 dark:after:shadow-blue-100/10 hover:after:shadow-3xl focus:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl dark:hover:after:shadow-3xl after:rounded"><span class="relative z-1"><!--[--><!--[--><span><span class="font-medium">RFC</span> <span class="font-bold">2137</span>:</span><!--]--><!--]--></span><!----><svg width="14" height="21" viewbox="0 0 11 7" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="motion-safe:transition-all absolute right-4 text-gray-200 group-hover:text-blue-400 group-focus:text-blue-400 dark:group-hover:text-blue-100 dark:group-focus:text-blue-100 transition-all group-hover:right-3 group-focus:right-3 -rotate-90 print:hidden bottom-[45%]" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.6262 1.34174L9.58022 0.334155C9.38658 0.14762 9.08009 0.14762 8.88645 0.334154L5.84688 3.26218C5.65324 3.44871 5.34676 3.44871 5.15312 3.26218L2.11355 0.334154C1.91991 0.14762 1.61342 0.14762 1.41978 0.334155L0.373816 1.34174C0.169662 1.5384 0.169662 1.86527 0.373816 2.06193L5.15311 6.66585C5.34676 6.85238 5.65324 6.85238 5.84688 6.66585L10.6262 2.06193C10.8303 1.86527 10.8303 1.5384 10.6262 1.34174Z"></path></svg></a><span class=""><!--[-->   <span></span><span class="relative z-3 font-normal"> Secure Domain Name System Dynamic Update</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h3><div class=""><!--[--><div class="md:pr-5 flex-1"><div class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-lg overflow-hidden print:text-sm print:leading-[2] relative z-1 print:m-0 text-xs font-semibold"><!--[--><div class="py-1 uppercase print:text-black print:bg-transparent print:border-1 print:border-black px-2 bg-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-800 text-white print:bg-white"><!--[-->Proposed Standard<!--]--></div><!--]--></div><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white"><!--[--><li class="inline"><!----><span class="whitespace-nowrap">D. Eastlake 3rd<!--[--><!--]--></span></li><!--]--></ul><ul class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block print:block text-base text-gray-800 mt-1 dark:text-white"><!----><!--[--><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><!---->April 1997</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>IETF publication</li><li class="inline text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="inline-block mx-2 rotate-45 align-middle print:bg-black print:opacity-100 print-with-background bg-gray-600 dark:bg-white opacity-50 w-[5px] h-[5px] align-middle"></span>Security Area</li><!--]--></ul><div class="block lg:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="abstract-rfc-2137" class="relative z-50 text-blue-800 cursor-pointer dark:text-blue-100 underline text-base p-3 -ml-3 -mt-2 -mb-3 print:hidden" aria-label="Show abstract for RFC 2137"><!--[-->Show abstract<!--]--></button><div id="abstract-rfc-2137" class="relative z-50 mt-3 hidden print:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 pt-3 border-t inline-block group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="leading-snug text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This memo describes how to use DNSSEC digital signatures covering requests and data to secure updates and restrict updates to those authorized to perform them as indicated by the updater&#39;s possession of cryptographic keys. [STANDARDS-TRACK]</p><!--]--></div></div></div><p class="relative z-1 text-red-800 dark:text-red-300 text-base print:text-black"><ul class="inline-block">Obsoleted by <span class="inline-block p-1 -m-1">RFC <b>3007</b></span></ul></p></div><div class="relative z-1 hidden lg:block"><h4 id="abstract" class="text-base font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-blue-900 dark:text-gray-300 inline-block mt-3 pt-2 border-t-1 border-gray-200 group"><!----><!--[--> Abstract <!--]--></h4><div class="pb-2 max-w-[34em] text-black dark:text-white leading-[1.5] text-pretty"><!--[--><p>This memo describes how to use DNSSEC digital signatures covering requests and data to secure updates and restrict updates to those authorized to perform them as indicated by the updater&#39;s possession of cryptographic keys. [STANDARDS-TRACK]</p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><ul class="flex w-fit flex-row -ml-1 -mb-1 gap-4 z-50 py-1 px-1"><li><div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-2 px-2 py-1"><div class="flex flex-col"><!--[--><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center cursor-pointer rounded text-sm text-center md:text-left font-bold hover:bg-sky-100 focus:bg-sky-100 before:absolute before:content-[&#39;&#39;] before:inset-0 before:rounded before:z-0 after:absolute after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:inset-0 after:z-40 after:transition-all text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-400 focus:text-blue-400 dark:hover: